 hours of gaming. They’re comfortable to wear, and the difference is noticeable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTZqvnV7Xs_text","label":"ggTZqvnV7Xs_text","default":"Emma J."},{"type":"html","id":"gggFiwJo6XB_text","label":"gggFiwJo6XB_text","default":"<strong>My Eyes Feel So Much Better!</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gge67UaFGXB_text","label":"gge67UaFGXB_text","default":"<p>I’ve been using these glasses for about a month now, and I can honestly say my eyes don’t feel as dry or strained as before. Perfect for long hours of screen use.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfh6SHGklm_text","label":"ggfh6SHGklm_text","default":"Tom R."},{"type":"html","id":"gg4mo3jP4_0_text","label":"gg4mo3jP4_0_text","default":"<strong>Totally Worth It!</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNwNEAkZAH_text","label":"ggNwNEAkZAH_text","default":"<p>I was skeptical at first, but after wearing these for a week, I’ve definitely noticed a difference. My eyes feel less tired, and my focus has improved. Totally worth it for anyone who spends a lot of time on screens.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg47WOco1NA_text","label":"gg47WOco1NA_text","default":"Natalie K."},{"type":"html","id":"ggQvr7ogGKR_text","label":"ggQvr7ogGKR_text","default":"<strong>No More Late-Night Eye Strain</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglRynFdf7m_text","label":"gglRynFdf7m_text","default":"<p>I used to struggle with eye strain after using my phone at night, but these glasses have been a game-changer. I’m sleeping better, and my eyes don’t feel sore anymore.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
